                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "So grateful to visit with the health care providers & patients at @stridechc in Wheat Ridge to learn about the basic care they provide for families who need it most in our community. \n\nBut because of Trump, many will be forced out of the care they need. I\u2019m working with local providers like STRIDE to highlight how essential these services are \u2013 our federal dollars should be going to the families who need support most, not more billionaires.",
