                "reply_count": 13,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "No family should ever have to choose between putting food on the table and getting the health care they need. \n\nEnhanced Premium Tax Credits have allowed thousands of Coloradans to access affordable coverage, but if Congress lets them expire, too many will be forced off their plans and left without the care they need.\n\nWe need a permanent fix, and we need it now. I urge my Republican colleagues to work with us to ensure families don't have their care ripped away.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
