                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "ICYMI - the Senate passed my bipartisan Support for Patients and Communities bill with @RepGuthrie \u2013 it will now head to the President\u2019s desk!\n\nThis fight is personal. I saw first-hand how broken our system was after watching my mom struggle with addiction for 30 years, which is why I have worked to change it. This bill will expand naloxone access, support treatment for women, strengthen the recovery workforce, and fund recovery centers.\n\nIt\u2019s hard to feel positive about progress right now as the republicans have decimated our health care system, but I still have to be proud if we are able to make even one positive step in the right direction to address the barriers people face. \nhttps://t.co/i7LqPUPS8Y",
                "text_lang": "en",
