                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump & Republicans want to strip health care from those who need it most, including by ending ACA tax credits that keep coverage affordable for families. And if they don\u2019t get their way, they\u2019re threatening a shutdown. There are just 2 days left to end this chaos & work with us on a path forward.",
