                "reply_count": 11,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am here in Washington, ready to work on a bipartisan path forward to lower health care costs & keep the government open.\n\nWe\u2019re just HOURS away from a shutdown & Republicans didn\u2019t even bother to show up.\n\nWe stand united to address the health care crisis by protecting coverage and addressing the skyrocketing costs of insurance that will hit constituents if we don\u2019t act NOW.",
