                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "Republicans gutted our health care system in their Big Ugly Bill \u2014 now millions are set to see their premiums double, if not TRIPLE in just a few weeks. For working families already struggling to make ends meet, it\u2019s untenable.\n\nInstead of lowering the costs of health care for working families, the GOP leaders are trying to distract us once again by spreading lies. They know that in order to qualify for the tax credits you have to be a citizen, or a legal resident and have to be a tax payer. Absolutely shameful. \nhttps://t.co/TgoB0utdlC",
