                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "Republicans\u2019 refusal to work with us is going to make it impossible for rural Coloradans to get life-saving care. Without action, Fremont, Custer, & Teller Counties are going to see their premiums increase by up to 283%. \n\nThis is about keeping families on their plans, making sure everyone has access to healthcare, and ensuring no one has to choose between paying their rent or their medical bills. Unfortunately, this really is life or death for too many.",
