                "retweet_count": 196,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Trump\u2019s continuing to build his ballroom that will cost taxpayers hundreds of millions of dollars while federal workers get fired, critical services get disrupted, & families see their health care premiums skyrocket.\n\nI don\u2019t know what could be a clearer picture of where his priorities lie \u2014 and that\u2019s not with the American people.",
