                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "At 25, Josh was diagnosed with leukemia. After surviving cancer and rebuilding his life, the ACA became his only path to affordable coverage. Losing these subsidies could make his care out of reach. Stories like Josh's are why we must ensure everyone can get the health care they need. \n\nI've been able to share a small fraction of the stories coming in from people across my district who don't know where they'll turn if Republicans don't act. I'm grateful to all those who have courageously shared their experiences, because every policy has a story and a name behind it.",
